id=maxregner_os
name=Maxregner OS 2.0 (Glass)
version=v39
versionCode=39
author=maxregner
description=Maxregner OS 2.0 — a real on-top glass layer for Android, delivered as a standalone Magisk module. Installs the Maxregner Glass RRO overlay (window blur + rounded corners) and sets the ro.maxregner.glass.* flags read by the firmware-injected Lio/mesalabs/unica/MaxregnerGlass; helper, then applies them at post-fs-data. Flash in Magisk Manager.
